{"id":"98143","t":{"th":"ธันเดอร์โบลท์ แฟนตาซี","ro":"Thunderbolt Fantasy: Touriken Yuuki","en":"Thunderbolt Fantasy: Sword Travels in the East","na":"Thunderbolt Fantasy -東離劍遊紀-"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx98143-PW8iwqFlNS4M.jpg","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/nx98143-PW8iwqFlNS4M.jpg","color":"#e4c9a1","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98143-y2uFgp97DeHK.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":13,"dur":23,"season":"SUMMER","year":2016,"start":"2016-07-08","country":"JP","genres":["Action","Drama","Fantasy"],"score":79,"pop":5755,"studio":"Pili International Multimedia","desc":"In an Eastern-styled fantasy setting, a brother and sister team of sacred guardians is beset by the Xuan Gui Zong, minions of Miè Tian Hai, who seeks the Tian Xing Jiàn sword that they possess. Hai's appearance leads to the defeat of the brother, but his sister, Dan Fei, jumps off a cliff to temporary safety. Later, a wandering swordsman comes across a ruined temple, where a statue of Buddha is protected by an umbrella against the rain. When he takes the umbrella for himself, a man resting under a tree nearby informs him that he must be compassionate to the next traveler he meets as a trade-off for taking the umbrella. That next traveler is Dan Fei, still being pursued by the Xuan Gui Zong minions. Both his promise and the enemy's sorcery leaves the wanderer unable to avoid getting involved.","descTh":"ในฉากแฟนตาซีสไตล์ตะวันออก ทีมพี่ชายและน้องสาวของผู้พิทักษ์ศักดิ์สิทธิ์ถูกรุมเร้าโดย Xuan Gui Zong ลูกน้องของ Miè Tian Hai ผู้แสวงหาดาบ Tian Xing Jiàn ที่พวกเขามี การปรากฏตัวของไห่นำไปสู่ความพ่ายแพ้ของพี่ชาย แต่ตันเฟย น้องสาวของเขา กระโดดลงจากหน้าผาเพื่อความปลอดภัยชั่วคราว ต่อมา นักดาบพเนจรไปพบซากวัดแห่งหนึ่งซึ่งมีพระพุทธรูปไว้บังฝนด้วยร่ม เมื่อเขาหยิบร่มขึ้นมาเอง ชายคนหนึ่งซึ่งอยู่ใต้ต้นไม้ใกล้ ๆ ก็บอกเขาว่าเขาจะต้องแสดงความเห็นอกเห็นใจต่อนักเดินทางคนต่อไปที่เขาพบเพื่อแลกกับการหยิบร่ม นักเดินทางรายต่อไปคือ Dan Fei ซึ่งยังคงถูกไล่ล่าโดยสมุน Xuan Gui Zong ทั้งคำสัญญาของเขาและเวทมนตร์ของศัตรูทำให้ผู้พเนจรไม่สามารถหลีกเลี่ยงการเข้าไปยุ่งได้","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":"licensor","descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"_5IjA8NvWiQ","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/98143","mal":null,"jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"dexclub","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLhRvvkzzD39jLvHiIxBPwehNDJUaYfP8K","lang":"sub","eps":[["8","y:as5m_pKHaNY",1761793583,"~",null,null,{"d":1435,"sk":[[0.4,89.0]]}],["9","y:aC-uXyOOH_4",1761793583,"~",null,null,{"d":1435,"sk":[[0.5,89.0]]}],["10","y:A82KfPGW218",1761793583,"~",null,null,{"d":1435,"sk":[[0.5,89.0]]}],["11","y:S5TJ55xZMhA",1761793583,"~",null,null,{"d":1435,"sk":[[0.5,89.0]]}],["12","y:u-vKnLU9HGM",1761793583,"~",null,null,{"d":1435,"sk":[[0.5,89.0]]}],["13","y:I2YxOatILQs",1761793583,"~",null,null,{"d":1435,"sk":[[1334.6,1423.5]],"fin":1}],["7","y:4y_fmewWm3Y",1730257583,"~",null,null,{"d":1435,"sk":[[0.5,89.0]]}],["6","y:e9uMahqPy9o",1729789225,"x",null,null,{"d":1434,"sk":[[0.5,89.0]]}],["5","y:pougjbNjCzY",1729616444,"x",null,null,{"d":1434,"sk":[[0.5,89.0]]}],["4","y:eGP4fjsW1D4",1729227633,"x",null,null,{"d":1434,"sk":[[0.5,89.0]]}],["3","y:gPRNkjpMkUY",1729054834,"x",null,null,{"d":1434,"sk":[[0.4,89.0]]}],["2","y:M9VcmpuAhbM",1728622812,"x",null,null,{"d":1434,"sk":[[0.5,89.0]]}],["1","y:n8esJj8mt-g",1728454467,"x",null,null,{"d":1434}]],"pat":"ทุกวันพุธ และ ศุกร์ 12:00 น."},{"p":"flixer","r":"TH","u":"https://www.flixerapp.com/video/143","lang":"sub","eps":[["1","https://www.flixerapp.com/video/143/01",null,"","f:TF/ep/01",null,{"d":1434}],["2","https://www.flixerapp.com/video/143/02",null,"","f:TF/ep/02",null,{"d":1434}],["3","https://www.flixerapp.com/video/143/03",null,"","f:TF/ep/03",null,{"d":1434}],["4","https://www.flixerapp.com/video/143/04",null,"","f:TF/ep/04",null,{"d":1434}],["5","https://www.flixerapp.com/video/143/05",null,"","f:TF/ep/05",null,{"d":1434}],["6","https